OL,3,GNEWSAMum hopes triplets can come home
OL,4,Afor Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FJessica and her partner, Aaron Packham,
OL,7,Fwho already have a nine-month-old
OL,8,Fdaughter, Elsie, attended regular scans
OL,9,Fthroughout the pregnancy as specialists
OL,10,Fat Medway NHS Foundation Trust
OL,11,Fmonitored the babies' progress.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
